//Abigail
"snm.DRTG_Abigail_movieTheater": "I'm excited to check out the movie theater, you got us.",
"snm.DRTG_Abigail_Resort_Leaving": "I'm gonna ask Willy if we can take the scenic route back. Thanks for helping him get the boat working.",
"snm.DRTG_Abigail_Resort_Umbrella_2": "Hey @, want to build a sand castle with me?#$e#Actually, a sand dungeon might be cooler! Have you found a dungeon in your exploring?$h",
"snm.DRTG_Abigail_Resort_Umbrella_3": "Hey @, you think you could build a raft? Of course you could, you got this entire place up and running. A raft would be nothing to you. #$e#I saw a few cool islands on the way here I want to visit.",
"snm.DRTG_Abigail_Resort_Wander": "Have you found any buried treasure? It's a big island and I bet you've explored it all. #$e#Quick, get me a shovel!#$e#Relax, I'm just kidding.$h",
"snm.DRTG_Abigail_cc_Bridge": "You fixed up the old bridge and I got to explore the quarry! It was so much fun! Thank you, @!", 
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Abigail_cc_Minecart": "What did you do to get the minecarts working?",
"snm.DRTG_Abigail_cc_Complete": "I wonder if the community center is still haunted? What do you think? I know you've spent a lot of time there.",
"snm.DRTG_Abigail_winter_28": "One year down, you must like it here.",


//Alex
"snm.DRTG_Alex_cc_Bridge": "I was on a run late last night and I noticed that the old bridge was repaired. How did you get it fixed up?",
"snm.DRTG_Alex_Resort_Entering": "Finally, we're here! Thank you for helping to get the boat up and running.",
"snm.DRTG_Alex_Resort_Towel": "Thanks for fixng the island up. Now there's no excuse to be pasty anymore!",
"snm.DRTG_Alex_Resort_Towel_2": "Man, it feels good to finally get these abs a little sunlight.#$e#Kind of a shame to have them hidden away all the time back home.",
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Alex_movieTheater": "You paying for the movies right? I heard you get a discount for helping to build it.",
"snm.DRTG_Alex_cc_Complete": "I guess you're famous now.",
"snm.DRTG_Alex_winter_28": "Next year is my year. #$e# Oh .. you'll have a good year also.",

//Caroline
"snm.DRTG_Caroline_Tue": "I love foraging. You never know what you find. What have you found?",
"snm.DRTG_Caroline_summer_Tue": "Summer has such pretty flowers.",
"snm.DRTG_Caroline_fall_Tue": "I've seen edible mushrooms in the forest.#$e#Foraging can be a fun way to earn some cash. Or you can use what you find as gifts or food.",
"snm.DRTG_Caroline_winter_Tue": "There's always so much holly to be found this time of year, but I never know what to do with it. Got any ideas?",
"snm.DRTG_Caroline_Resort_Leaving": "Thanks for fixing this place up. It was a lovely day. I'll sleep well tonight!$h",
"snm.DRTG_Caroline_Resort_Shore": "The water is so warm here compared to the valley. It's really pleasant! It's amazing how you got the Island Resort fixed up.",
"snm.DRTG_Caroline_Resort": "Hi, @. Are you here to relax, or to do work? You've already done so much work on the Island. You should relax.",		
"snm.DRTG_Caroline_cc_Complete": "The Community Center looks good again. Thanks for fixing it up.",
"snm.DRTG_Caroline_movieTheater": "How did you get a Movie Theater built so fast? It's wonderful.",
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Caroline_cc_Bridge": "The old bridge is fixed. Thank you. Pierre and I used to take walks over there. Good memories.",

//Clint
"snm.DRTG_Clint_Tue": "I've been doing a lot of tool upgrades recently. Don't forget to bring me yours for upgrades.",
"snm.DRTG_Clint_Wed": "I'm busy upgrading pick axes for adventurers. What can I help you with?",
"snm.DRTG_Clint_Thu": "Another busy day.",
"snm.DRTG_Clint_Sat": "I used to wonder how I ended up in this town. Not anymore, I picked a good place to be. Lots of business since you got here.",
"snm.DRTG_Clint_Sun": "I need a day off.",
"snm.DRTG_Clint_Resort_Entering": "This place is great! Thanks for fixing it up. I'm gonna put on my special red trunks. They're supposed to be really eye-catching.",
"snm.DRTG_Clint_Resort_Leaving": "This was a nice day. Thanks for your hard work to fix the resort.",
"snm.DRTG_Clint_Resort_Bar": "I'm hungry, let's see what goodies Gus has today. What a great place.",
"snm.DRTG_Clint_Resort": "A beautiful day thanks to your hard work.",
"snm.DRTG_Clint_cc_Minecart": "The old town minecart system started working again. Thank you. It's very convenient for getting to and from the mines.",
"snm.DRTG_Clint_cc_Bridge": "You got the old bridge fixed up! Thanks, @.", 
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Clint_movieTheater": "I wonder if anyone will go to the movies with me.", 
"snm.DRTG_Clint_cc_Complete": "The old boiler room, more work for me. Sigh #$e# Oh yeah good job fixing the place up.", 

//Demetrius
"snm.DRTG_Demetrius_summer_Fri": "$p 40#So I heard Maru had you look through that telescope out back. It's amazing to see so much in the night sky.",
"snm.DRTG_Demetrius_Resort_Leaving": "I'll be analyzing this data for months. You worked really hard on this Island.",
"snm.DRTG_Demetrius_Resort_Chair": "Are you having fun, @? You fixed this place up, it's time to relax",
"snm.DRTG_Demetrius_Resort": "What an amazing place you found. It's teeming with exotic life!",
"snm.DRTG_Demetrius_Sun": "It's good to take a break from work every now and then.#$e#I guess that's kind of difficult with everything you do for this town.",
"snm.DRTG_Demetrius_winter_Tue": "Talk to my wife if you need any work done.",
"snm.DRTG_Demetrius_winter_Wed": "Cooking is kind of like doing lab work.",
"snm.DRTG_Demetrius_cc_Bridge": "I heard you fixed the old bridge. I'm looking forward to finding what plants and animals the quary has.",
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Demetrius_cc_Complete": "How did you get the community center up and running again?",

//Elliot
"snm.DRTG_Elliot_Resort_Entering": "That was quite the ride! You did well helping Willy fix his boat",
"snm.DRTG_Elliot_Resort_Wander": "I've heard rumors of pirates coming to shore near here at night. They say it can get pretty wild! Have you seen any in your exploration of the island?",
"snm.DRTG_Elliot_Resort": "I must admit, this beach blows my own humble strand out of the water. Thank you for fixing the resort.",
"snm.DRTG_Elliot_Wed": "The forest is a wonderful place. I'm sure you have been there many a time.",
"snm.DRTG_Elliot_fall_Tue": "It's been said that a pirate's ship, full of plundered gold, shipwrecked here long ago. I wonder if you have found one in your travels?",
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Elliot_cc_Bridge": "An old bridge brought back to life. I need to go write this down.",
"snm.DRTG_Elliot_cc_Complete": "The community center is full of life now. Marvelous",
"snm.DRTG_Elliot_movieTheater": "I love a good movie but books are always better.",
				
//Emily
"snm.DRTG_Emily_reject_866": "Oh, that's beautiful... I bet Sandy would love that.", 
"snm.DRTG_Emily_Resort_Entering": "Oh, I like this place! It's full of parrots! How did you ever find it?",
"snm.DRTG_Emily_Resort_Leaving": "Ah... my lungs feel perfect. Thank you for all your work.", 
"snm.DRTG_Emily_Resort_Bar": "You fixed this place up and now I get to be on this side of the bar for once. It's nice.$h",
"snm.DRTG_Emily_fall_Wed": "When you go to the desert say hi to Sandy.",
"snm.DRTG_Emily_fall_Thu": "Clint's a nice guy but he's so shy. I'm glad you're his friend.",
"snm.DRTG_Emily_cc_Bus": "I'm so happy you got the bus working again. I can see Sandy again!",
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Emily_Mon": "Haley is a good sister, even if we don't always agree.",
"snm.DRTG_Emily_Tue8": "You know, @... I think the future looks bright for both of us. Actually for this town, you've done a lot of good.",
"snm.DRTG_Emily_Sun4": "This house was left in our care by my parents. They've been traveling the world for years now.#$e#We have no idea when they'll be back.#$e#I enjoy living here, though. It's a beautiful area and the town is nice.",

//Evelyn 
"snm.DRTG_Evelyn_Tue": "Don't mind George, honey, he can be grumpy at times.#$e#Do you have any leeks? He loves them!",
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Evelyn_winter_28": "It's been a good year. I'm glad you are here.",
"snm.DRTG_Evelyn_winter_Sat8": "@, have I told you that George and I have lived in our house for over 30 years?#$e#I hope you stay here for a while.$h",

//George 
"snm.DRTG_George_Mon": "I'm not much of a talker.",
"snm.DRTG_George_Wed": "Alex is the best grandson I could've asked for.",
"snm.DRTG_George_Fri": "How's your farm going?",		
"snm.DRTG_George_movieTheater": "You got us a Movie Theater? I'm going to take Evelyn out for a date!",
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_George_winter_28": "Another year gone, glad you're here.",
"snm.DRTG_George_winter_Sat8": "@, This old house always needs some work. Can you work your magic and fix the sink? ",

//Gus
"snm.DRTG_Gus_Resort_Entering": "Hey, @! Glad you're here. You did an amazing job fixing this place up.",
"snm.DRTG_Gus_Resort_Leaving": "Hey, thanks again for all your hard work. I'll see you back home, @.",
"snm.DRTG_Gus_Resort": "Maybe you could do a remodel on the Stardrop Saloon? I mean, look at how beautiful this place is.",
"snm.DRTG_Gus_Thu": "Pam and Clint come into the saloon almost every night. I used to worry I would go out of business without them, but since you moved in, there're more tourists and they spend big.",
"snm.DRTG_Gus_Sat": "Are you much of a chef? We should exchange receipes if you ever take a break from all you do for this town.",
"snm.DRTG_Gus_Sun": "Business has been getting better since you've been here. You're popular!",
"snm.DRTG_Gus_cc_Complete": "I'm looking forward to cooking in the Community Center kitchen. Thanks for fixing it up.",
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Gus_winter_28": "Congrulations on a productive year.",

//Haley
"snm.DRTG_Haley_Resort_Entering": "I saw a dolphin on the way in! I almost can't belive you helped make this possible.",
"snm.DRTG_Haley_Resort_Shore": "It's strange, the places life can take you... who knows what other lands are out there? Tell me about the places you've explored.",
"snm.DRTG_Haley_Resort_Towel_2": "Laying out on a tropical beach.#$b#*sigh* I think I've finally found my place in the universe.#$e#But I guess Stardew Valley's not such a bad place either, especially when I can vacation here!",
"snm.DRTG_Haley_Resort_Bar": "Gus made a cute, fruity drink just for me!$h I'm glad you fixed up the resort bar.",
"snm.DRTG_Haley_Resort": "This is such a perfect beach. I'd stay here forever if I could! I wish I could stay at the Island house you fixed up, but I would miss Emily and my friends.",
"snm.DRTG_Haley_summer_Tue": "Dirty again, huh? You seem to always be working.",
"snm.DRTG_Haley_winter_Tue2": "Hi @",
"snm.DRTG_Haley_winter_Sun6": "I'm busy today.",
"snm.DRTG_Haley_cc_Bus": "Now that you got the bus running again, I'm going shopping!",
//Added with 4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Haley_cc_Complete": "You surprise me.",

//Harvey
"snm.DRTG_Harvey_Mon10": "It's always good to see you. ", 
"snm.DRTG_Harvey_Sun": "I've been doing online visits with patients. It's helped me pay my bills and helped people who can't get to the doctor.",
"snm.DRTG_Harvey_summer_Fri": "People don't get sick much in the summer, which is good. I have more time to spend with the patients I have either online or in person.",
"snm.DRTG_Harvey_winter_Sun": "Flu season is always busy. I've had a lot of new patients lately.",
"snm.DRTG_Harvey_Resort_Shore": "I combed the whole beach for glass. We wouldn't want anyone to get a cut on their foot! I didn't find much - you did a great job when you got this place up and running.",
"snm.DRTG_Harvey_Resort_Chair": "It's nice to have an opportunity to relax now and then. Thank you for fixing this place up. #$b#The trouble is actually letting go of your worries...$s",
"snm.DRTG_Harvey_Resort": "I'll let you in on a little secret... Only cause you got the resort up and running.... I can only swim with floaties.$s",
"snm.DRTG_Harvey_cc_Bus": "It's good you got the bus running again. I can visit patients outside of Pelican Town",
//Added with 4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Harvey_cc_Complete": "Good job fixing the community center. Being an active part of the community is good for your health.",

//Jas
"snm.DRTG_Jas_Thu2": "Miss Penny is teaching me how to read cursive, and sign my name.",
"snm.DRTG_Jas_Resort_Entering": "I see a crab! What animals have you seen?",
"snm.DRTG_Jas_Resort_Leaving": "I had so much fun today even though I've got sand in my shoes.#$e#Aunt Marnie said I should say thank you for the resort. So, uhm... Thank you!",
"snm.DRTG_Jas_Thu": "Hello",
"snm.DRTG_Jas_Fri": "Hello",
"snm.DRTG_Jas_Sun": "Um... d...do you want something?$u#$e#",
"snm.DRTG_Jas_Sat2": "Sometimes I look for crawdads in the river.",
//Added with 4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Jas_cc_Complete": "The community center is all new and pretty now. Thanks",

//Jodi
"snm.DRTG_Jodi_cc_Bus": "You got the bus up and running again. I'm sure Pam is happy about that...#$b#I heard she'd been drinking more after losing her job... so hopefully this helps.",
"snm.DRTG_Jodi_Resort_Entering": "You fixed this place up! Wow, what a treat! Thank you.",
"snm.DRTG_Jodi_Resort": "The view is breathtaking! Deep blue as far as the eye can see...",
"snm.DRTG_Jodi_Resort_Bar": "We all love it when you and Gus show up. You built the bar and he makes the drinks.",
//Added with 4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Jodi_cc_Complete": "I'm proud of you for fixing the community center.",
"snm.DRTG_Jodi_movieTheater": "Kent and I used to go to the movies all the time. Just the two of us. Such good memories.",

//Kent
"snm.DRTG_Kent_Resort_Leaving": "Time to head home. Thanks for fixing this place up.",
"snm.DRTG_Kent_Resort": "The boat ride was fun. I even got to use some of my nautical training to help navigate. Willy told me you helped fix up the boat. Thanks",
"snm.DRTG_Kent_Tue": "Sometimes it feels like nothing has changed since I've been gone. Except for you and your farm getting fixed up.",
"snm.DRTG_Kent_Tue2": "You've done a lot for this town. It's hard to get used to change.",
"snm.DRTG_Kent_Thu": "Sam and Vincent grew up so much while I was gone.",	 
"snm.DRTG_Kent_cc_Complete": "You fixed up the Community Center. That must have taken a lot of hard work.",
//added V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Kent_movieTheater": "You've done so much for this town.",
"snm.DRTG_Kent_married": "Congratulations, @. I hope you have a great marriage. Just remember it takes work.",

//Leah
"snm.DRTG_Leah_summer_Fri": "I love maple syrup.",
"snm.DRTG_Leah_Resort_Entering": "Don't tell anyone, but Willy let me steer the boat for a few minutes. He told me you provided all the supplies to fix it up. That was nice of you.",
"snm.DRTG_Leah_Resort_Leaving": "Well, that was deeply relaxing. Thanks for fixing this place up. ",
"snm.DRTG_Leah_cc_Complete": "Now that you fixed up the Community Center, I'm going to be using the crafts room a lot.",
"snm.DRTG_Leah_cc_Bus": "I'm glad you got the bus fixed. I'm going to go to the desert and paint.",
//added V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Leah_fall_Fri": "I wish I had a kitchen so I could cook all kinds of delicious meals.$h",

//Lewis 
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_Tue2": "Did you know scythes has been used forever to clear dead crops and cut grass?", 
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_fall_12": "It's interesting how bees produce different types of honey based on the flowers near them.",
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_cc_Bridge": "I'm shocked that you were able to get the bridge fixed up. What kind of magic do you have?",
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_cc_Bus": "@, how did you get the bus fixed up? It's going to help the town a lot.",
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_summer_Sat": "Everyone seems a little happier on the weekends, don't you think? Of course, we're on the job seven days a week.",
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_fall_Mon": "You've made a lot of friends since you got here.",
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_fall_Wed": "You've done a lot for our town.",
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_winter_Tue": "Any ideas on how we can improve the town?",
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_winter_Wed": "I'll still come by every night to collect what you're selling, even in the snow.#$e#You still need to make money in the winter!",  
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_cc_Minecart": "Clint told me the minecarts are working. You worked some of your magic, didn't you?",
//added with V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Lewis_winter_28": "It's been a good year. Glad you are here.",

//Linus 
"snm.DRTG_Linus_Tue": "I try not to bother anyone. I'm just minding my own business.",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_Wed": "Why are you here so often?",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_Thu": "...Hmm? Hello",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_Fri": "People have destroyed my tent before.$s",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_Sat": "I'm happy by myself, you know.#$e#",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_Sun": "#$1 linusVandal#A stranger was throwing rocks at my tent last night... I just had to wait it out.$s$k#$e#I don't like to stay in one place for too long. There's just too much to experience in the world.",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_fall_Tue4": "#$1 LinusFall1#Some stranger sprayed paint all over my home during the night... It took hours to scrub it off this morning.$k#$e#I need to start gathering lumber for the winter.#$e#Do you have enough lumber to keep your house warm?",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_cc_Minecart": "The minecarts are working again. That will make exploring easier.",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_cc_Bridge": "How did you get the bridge repaired?",
//Added V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Linus_winter_28": "I think I'm going to stay here for awhile.",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_cc_Complete": "I hope people use the Community Center now that it's fixed up again.",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_divorced_once": "Divorced, Hmm.",
"snm.DRTG_Linus_divorced_twice": "Another divorce? That's sad.",

//Marnie
"snm.DRTG_Marnie_Wed": "Make sure to always have enough hay for your animals.", 
"snm.DRTG_Marnie_Thu": "Hi. What can I help you with?", 
"snm.DRTG_Marnie_Mon": "I love all animals.",
"snm.DRTG_Marnie_Sat": "The Wizard's tower is scary.#$e#One time I heard this terrible, otherworldly noise coming from there.$s#$e#I would avoid that place if I were you...",
"snm.DRTG_Marnie_Resort_Leaving": "I feel warm. You did a great job fixing this place up.",
"snm.DRTG_Marnie_Resort_Bar": "This place is perfect. You even got us a bar!",
"snm.DRTG_Marnie_cc_Complete": "I'm so happy you got the Community Center fixed up.",
"snm.DRTG_Marnie_movieTheater": "I'm looking forward to going to the Movie Theater. ",
//Added V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Marnie_married": "Your wedding was lovely, so happy for you.",
"snm.DRTG_Marnie_married_twice": "Another lovely wedding.",

//Maru
"snm.DRTG_Maru_Resort_Leaving": "That was fun! I'm glad you fixed this place up.",
"snm.DRTG_Maru_Tue": "I think my mom has worked on every building in town.",
"snm.DRTG_Maru_Wed": "I like working at Harvey's clinic.#$b#He says he likes having me around in case his medical equipment goes haywire!$h#$e#",
"snm.DRTG_Maru_Sat": "I love helping my dad in his laboratory.",
"snm.DRTG_Maru_Tue2": "Stop by our house anytime.#$e#It's always nice to have visitors.",
"snm.DRTG_Maru_summer_Tue": "Sebastian and I are very different, but that's okay.",
"snm.DRTG_Maru_summer_Tue4": "Sebastian hardly ever talks to me. Actually, he hardly talks to anyone.",
"snm.DRTG_Maru_summer_Fri": "I worked at the clinic yesterday. Harvey had 4 online visits. He's great with patients but not so good with competers.",
"snm.DRTG_Maru_fall_Mon": "Have you found anything in the mines recently?",
"snm.DRTG_Maru_fall_Fri": "Since Doctor Harvey started online visits, it feels like we never have a slow day.", 
"snm.DRTG_Maru_cc_Bridge": "Dad and I are going to explore the quarry now that the bridge is fixed! Who knows what we might find?",
"snm.DRTG_Maru_cc_Minecart": "How did you get the minecarts working?",

//Pam
"snm.DRTG_Pam_Resort_Shore": "What kind of fish have you seen around here? I bet there's a lot of unique ones. Next time, I'll have to bring my pole!",
"snm.DRTG_Pam_Resort_Bar": "It's a special occasion, kid... look at this place you found.",
"snm.DRTG_Pam_Saloon6": "Hey, kid. Buy me a drink. I know that farm of yours is doing well.",
"snm.DRTG_Pam_Tue": "Hey, you! Don't be snoopin' round the trailer when I'm out.",
"snm.DRTG_Pam_Sun": "Gus's a pretty good guy.#$e#He gives me free beer on my birthday.",
"snm.DRTG_Pam_summer_Thu": "Oh, hi there, farmer.",
"snm.DRTG_Pam_fall_Sun": "What are you working on today?",	
"snm.DRTG_Pam_fall_Thu": "Penny's always going to be my baby.",
"snm.DRTG_Pam_cc_Complete": "The Community Center looks good; you should fix up my place next.",
"snm.DRTG_Pam_movieTheater": "Ugh, why are the movie tickets so much? You helped get the theater here, you should make tickets cheaper.",
//Added V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Pam_divorced_once": "Divorced? How did you screw things up? ",
"snm.DRTG_Pam_divorced_twice": "Divorced again? What did you do wrong?",

//Penny
"snm.DRTG_Penny_Resort_Entering": "This Island is so beautiful; and you fixed it up so nice.",
"snm.DRTG_Penny_Resort_Leaving": "I had a great time. You've done so much for the town.",
"snm.DRTG_Penny_Resort": "Thank you for fixing this place. The sand here is so soft and fine. It feels great on my toes!$h",
"snm.DRTG_Penny_Sun": "Hello. It's a nice day.",
"snm.DRTG_Penny_summer_Mon": "It's a beautiful day.",
"snm.DRTG_Penny_summer_Sun": "I would love to see how your house is decorated.",
"snm.DRTG_Penny_summer_Sat": "Hello, @",
"snm.DRTG_Penny_fall_Mon": "Hi, @. How is your day going?",
"snm.DRTG_Penny_fall_Sat8": "Hi, @. Is your farmhouse easy to clean?", 
"snm.DRTG_Penny_winter_Fri": "Hello",
"snm.DRTG_Penny_winter_Fri2": "Linus lives in a tent up in the mountains.#$e#Everyone ignores him, the poor guy. He's actually really nice... just a little odd.#$e#It must be so cold to live in a tent this time of year.",
"snm.DRTG_Penny_winter_Thu": "Oh... hi. You want to talk?$u#$e Gunther is always looking for items to display in the museum.",

//Pierre
"snm.DRTG_Pierre_eventSeen_3102768_memory_oneweek": "I love running this shop.",
"snm.DRTG_Pierre_Resort_Shore": "Did you get paid to fix up this place?",
"snm.DRTG_Pierre_Resort_Chair": "It's hard to relax, isn't it? I wonder what your next project will be.",
"snm.DRTG_Pierre_winter_Fri": "It can be hard to get good produce in winter.",
"snm.DRTG_Pierre_fall_Mon": "Fall seeds are here. You should go all out!",
"snm.DRTG_Pierre_movieTheater": "The movie theater charges so much for a ticket. Do you get a cut from their sales since you helped build it?",
//added V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Pierre_divorced_once": "Divorce or not, you still need to buy all your seeds from me.",
"snm.DRTG_Pierre_divorced_twice": "Divorced again. If you plan to try again I've got bouquets for sale.",

//Robin
"snm.DRTG_Robin_summer_Tue": "I like working on your farm, planning anymore buildings or upgrades?",
"snm.DRTG_Robin_Resort": "Wow, look at these structures! I can tell they were made by a master builder. Who helped you?",
"snm.DRTG_Robin_cc_Bridge": "Hey! How did you get the quarry bridge repaired?#$b#It's a miracle of woodworking!",
"snm.DRTG_Robin_Fri": "Sebastian can be a bit shy even with us. It's just who he is.",
"snm.DRTG_Robin_winter_Mon": "Hey, it's the perfect time of year to gather wood and stone.",

//Sam
"snm.DRTG_Sam_Wed6": "I've been friends with Sebastian for a while. He's a pretty cool guy.", 
"snm.DRTG_Sam_Resort_Entering": "Wow, what a spot! Is the rest of the island like this?",
"snm.DRTG_Sam_Resort": "I bet there's some cool stuff deeper on the island.#$e#Willy said we have to stay here, though... some kind of liability issues or something. Couldn't we at least go to the island house you mentioned?",
"snm.DRTG_Sam_Thu_2": "I'm really glad my dad's back and he's okay.",
"snm.DRTG_Sam_Thu2_2": "I'm really glad my dad's back and he's okay.",
"snm.DRTG_Sam_10": "Did you watch the game last night?",
"snm.DRTG_Sam_summer_Mon6": "You can find some interesting things in the desert. Dad took me a couple times when I was younger.",
"snm.DRTG_Sam_fall_Mon": "Oh, hi. You seem to be making lots of friends. #$e#Bye.",
"snm.DRTG_Sam_cc_Bus": "The bus is fixed, we can go see the desert again.",
"snm.DRTG_Sam_cc_Complete": "I've been thinking about a new song called Town Hero. Any ideas?",

//Sandy 
"snm.DRTG_Sandy_Thu2": "The back is offlimits to almost everyone. That's all I know.", 
"snm.DRTG_Sandy_Thu4": "The back is offlimits to almost everyone." , 
"snm.DRTG_Sandy_Sun8": "Hi, @!",		  
"snm.DRTG_Sandy_cc_Complete": "Emily told me you're the town hero.",
"snm.DRTG_Sandy_movieTheater": "Emily told me you got Pelican Town a Movie Theater. I really need to visit more.",

//Sebastian
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_Resort_Leaving": "It's a nice place you found, but I'm ready to get back home.",
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_Resort": "The beach is nice, but I don't love the crowds. Have you found anyplace with no people?",
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_Resort_Towel": "It's good to get away from the computer and see the real world sometimes. I forget how nice it can be. Thanks for fixing this place up.",
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_Mon": "Hello.",
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_Fri": "Hello.",
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_Sun": "Hey.",
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_fall_Mon4": "How is it going on the farm?",
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_winter_Tue": "Hmm... I don't really have anything to say.",
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_winter_Sun6": "I built a snowgoon and Maru made a cute snowperson.",   
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_cc_Complete": "I hope no one is going to expect me to go to the Community Center and be around people.",
"snm.DRTG_Sebastian_movieTheater": "I like movies, but I would rather wait until it's online so I don't have to deal with people.",

//Shane
"snm.DRTG_Shane_Resort_Entering": "You put a bar in, right? I need a drink.",
"snm.DRTG_Shane_Resort_Bar": "Phew... Glad you put a bar in. I'm going to relax with a drink or two.", //corrected V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Shane_cc_Complete": "Town hero? Huh.",

//Vincent
"snm.DRTG_Vincent_Resort_Entering": "That was fun! I wanna be a boat captain some day! Mom said you helped fix the boat.",
"snm.DRTG_Vincent_Resort_Shore": "I wanna see a shark! Have you seen one? Mom said you've been all over this island.",
"snm.DRTG_Vincent_cc_Complete": "What's a town hero?",
"snm.DRTG_Vincent_movieTheater": "I want to go to the movies.",
//added V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Vincent_cc_Bridge": "You fixed the bridge. Cool.",
"snm.DRTG_Vincent_cc_Bus": "Sam is going to take me to the desert.",

//Willy 
"snm.DRTG_Willy_Sat": "How's my favorite customer?",
"snm.DRTG_Willy_Sun": "Having the right bait and tackle makes a huge difference in fishing.",
"snm.DRTG_Willy_Sun10": "Hey, it's my skipper! You doing okay?",
//added V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Willy_divorced_once": "Well at least you have more time to fish",

//Wizard
"snm.DRTG_Wizard_cc_Minecart": "I see the junimo are helping you.",
"snm.DRTG_Wizard_cc_Bridge": "Junimo magic is powerful.",
"snm.DRTG_Wizard_cc_Bus": "The desert is full of magic.",
"snm.DRTG_Wizard_cc_Complete": "Ah, you and the junimo have completed the Center. Well done on your accomplishment.",
//added V4.5.0
"snm.DRTG_Wizard_divorced_once": "I had hoped you would do better than me. Marriage is hard.",
